ood at fishing! Reckon there's room for improvement, though!","nextNodeIds":[722080102,722080103]},{"nodeId":722080102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3886906034,"text":"Eh!?","nextNodeIds":[722080104]},{"nodeId":722080104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20430,"speakerName":"Ipe","textMapHash":3020978986,"text":"Ahaha, sorry, sorry... I always forget to say hi and all. Easy to forget that I might scare people, you know?","nextNodeIds":[722080105]},{"nodeId":722080105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1587322002,"text":"Doesn't seem to stop you from enjoying it...","nextNodeIds":[722080106]},{"nodeId":722080106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20430,"speakerName":"Ipe","textMapHash":2073603306,"text":"Aw, come on~ Scaring kids is fun from time to time, don'cha think?","nextNodeIds":[722080107]},{"nodeId":722080107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20430,"speakerName":"Ipe","textMapHash":289923210,"text":"*cough* Anyway, let's get back to talking about fishing.","nextNodeIds":[722080108,722080109]},{"nodeId":722080108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":649567306,"text":"What, is it serious business?","nextNodeIds":[722080110]},{"nodeId":722080110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20430,"speakerName":"Ipe","textMapHash":2889630650,"text":"Well, so, I know this isn't the best look... But when I was fishing earlier, I dropped the charm that Makiri gave me. It's got blessings from her ancestral spirits and the Great Thunderbird in it.","nextNodeIds":[722080111]},{"nodeId":722080111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20430,"speakerName":"Ipe","textMapHash":3404814602,"text":"I... I don't know what I'd tell her if she found out that I lost it after we board the boat...","nextNodeIds":[722080112]},{"nodeId":722080112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20430,"speakerName":"Ipe","textMapHash":156103634,"text":"The golden boat-guy said that he'd scrounge some people up to help me search, but it doesn't look like anyone's coming! So I thought that since you're here, you can help me out too!","nextNodeIds":[722080113,722080114]},{"nodeId":722080113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2497873098,"text":"And here I thought you were the reliable one...","nextNodeIds":[722080115]},{"nodeId":722080115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20430,"speakerName":"Ipe","textMapHash":2519775058,"text":"My usual fishing spot's just over there, but... my memory's getting weaker and weaker somehow, so I'm afraid that I've gotta leave it to you to help me search...","nextNodeIds":[722080116,722080117]},{"nodeId":722080116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3623147834,"text":"Since it's a place of ancient memory...","nextNodeIds":[722080118]},{"nodeId":722080118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20430,"speakerName":"Ipe","textMapHash":70384826,"text":"Eh? What do you mean? Is this some way in which you outsiders find things?","nextNodeIds":[722080119]},{"nodeId":722080119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20430,"speakerName":"Ipe","textMapHash":1046803490,"text":"*sigh* Well, whatever it might be, you should be able to find the charm as long as you find the right spot.","nextNodeIds":[722080120]},{"nodeId":722080120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1284713866,"text":"And how will I search for the charm itself?","nextNodeIds":[722080121]},{"nodeId":722080121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20430,"speakerName":"Ipe","textMapHash":1678924746,"text":"Uhh... By fishing it out of the water?","nextNodeIds":[722080122]},{"nodeId":722080122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2594934082,"text":"...I guess that works.","nextNodeIds":[722080123]},{"nodeId":722080123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20430,"speakerName":"Ipe","textMapHash":3568714514,"text":"Thank you, friend from afar! May the Great Thunderbird and our ancestors protect you!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722080117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":400869474,"text":"I guess the \"feather\" should do the trick...","nextNodeIds":[722080118]},{"nodeId":722080114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3473069306,"text":"You're hopeless...","nextNodeIds":[722080199]},{"nodeId":722080199,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20430,"speakerName":"Ipe","textMapHash":1890615418,"text":"There is an isle west of the Autake Plains that faces three waterfalls. It should be in the sea further west of that small island...","nextNodeIds":[722080115]},{"nodeId":722080109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3351924546,"text":"You really love fishing, don't you...","nextNodeIds":[722080110]},{"nodeId":722080103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3271102746,"text":"What happened to greeting before deciding to just show up?","nextNodeIds":[722080104]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"72208_FinishMan_Start"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7220802,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":0,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKEL